How to use this doc





Find a table in Alphabetized table list.



See its domain in Domain map.



Trace FKs in Foreign-key edges (from.column → to.column).



Start from hubs in Hub tables if you need “what points at X?”.



Remember polymorphic tables (entity_*, article_content.entity_*, field_history) often do not have typed FKs to every target entity — only to shared refs like user_profiles / tags.





